From 317bfafeba45153ce8d7e9119f6122acd6ce4201 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>
Date: Sun, 27 Sep 2026 08:16:31 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix: make the merged suite pass on current Flutter

Return immediately after markTestSkipped so tests that need a local
Supabase skip instead of failing when port 54321 is closed. Format
whole-kilogram strength summaries as 80kg, clear the account-deletion
spinner before the unavailable dialog, and treat keyboard dismiss as
the text field losing focus.

Co-authored-by: naruto-aii <naruto-aii@users.noreply.github.com>
---
